WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.885
See how an operating system coordinates programs and hardware.

00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:08.845
The OS schedules processes and coordinates memory and devices.

00:00:08.845 --> 00:00:15.005
CPU time is shared in short intervals; multiple cores can also execute work simultaneously.

00:00:16.005 --> 00:00:19.323
An executing instance of a program is a.

00:00:19.323 --> 00:00:23.885
A process includes executing instructions and their associated state and resources.
